{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "_readme": [
    "Known-ground-truth assets for regression-testing the RINSE AI detectors.",
    "Run via: .venv/bin/python scripts/regression_check.py [--live]",
    "Labels: 'ai' = AI-generated, 'human' = confirmed human-made.",
    "Instagram posts go through yt-dlp on the server (social platform pages).",
    "Brave image-search proxy URLs are decoded to the original source by the",
    "server automatically (see _decode_proxy_original_url in server.py).",
    "'kind' field: image (deep path) or video (shot-aware video deep path).",
    "'tier_expect' is the acceptable verdict tier set for a PASS."
  ],
